    "summary": "Spend 1 CP in your [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase) or either player's [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase) on a **KROOT** unit of yours not yet picked to shoot or fight in this phase.\n\nWhen the chosen unit's attacks this phase are resolved, pick 1 enemy unit that at least one of them hit. For the rest of the phase, whenever a **KROOT** model of yours attacks that enemy unit, improve the attack's Armour Penetration by 1, unless the attacker's unit is [Battle-shocked](vsdata:core-rule/battle-shock).",
